doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title Failure to complete action

  body
      p The deadline for "#{actionName}" has passed and you have not completed it. If you did complete it, please contact us. We may have made a mistake.

      p Since this was your first Alliance action, we want to explain why reliability matters. We plan each action around the number of members assigned to it. When members don't follow through, those plans fall short.

      p If you miss all of your assigned non-optional actions for three weeks in a row, your contract will be suspended automatically.
